\V 1
\begindata{text,36222760960}
\textdsversion{12}
Mental Floss served "8 \htmlatk-link{foods people in \htmlatk-italic{The 
Odyssey}} might have actually eaten."


---


\htmlatk-italic{Epithet}, for example. Merriam-Webster looked up several 
\htmlatk-link{English words that can trace their origin to the Greek} 
language and \htmlatk-italic{The Odyssey}.


---


Headline of the day: "\htmlatk-link{George R.R. Martin hands agent} 
unsolicited, 4,000-page manuscript titled \htmlatk-italic{Tuba Man, Scuba 
Man}." (via the satirical minds at the \htmlatk-italic{Onion})


\enddata{text,36222760960}
